        "status": "present",
        "value": "For each word at position i, for every prefix length p from 1 to len and every suffix start s from 0 to len-1, set map[word[:p] + '#' + word[s:]] = i. Because words are visited in increasing i, later words overwrite earlier ones. f(pref, suff) returns map.get(pref + '#' + suff, -1). The JavaScript version uses a Map and converts undefined to -1."
      },
